WEBVTT

00:12:27.974 --> 00:12:30.646
Reverend Ralph Abernathy

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:32.468
and so many others,

00:12:33.387 --> 00:12:35.753
I don't know what
would have happened to me.

00:12:35.777 --> 00:12:37.698
I could have been lost.

00:12:40.459 --> 00:12:43.522
But for Martin Luther King, Jr, to ...

00:12:46.475 --> 00:12:48.602
sent me a round trip
Greyhound bus ticket

00:12:48.626 --> 00:12:51.217
and invited me to come
to Montgomery to meet with him,

00:12:51.241 --> 00:12:52.922
my first Baptist church --

00:12:54.332 --> 00:12:55.843
it's impossible,

00:12:55.867 --> 00:12:57.317
impossible

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:00.916
for a poor, barefooted boy